This is a placeholder note for analyzer compatibility. The actual Gradle Wrapper JAR is downloaded automatically
by the Gradle Wrapper scripts on first run into this exact path:
  gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

To fetch it, run:
  ./gradlew --version
or any Gradle task. The project also includes a working wrapper under:
  content-rating-display-213568/vod_content_rating_frontend/gradlew
